COMPILER-RT
===========

Original source is the compiler-rt directory of the LLVM project:
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project

tag    = llvmorg-23.1.5
commit = 392dfff97d29b59d77e5cac6d4b6ef2585fe7117
date   = 2 November 2026

Only the x86_64 builtins (the libgcc replacement) and crtbegin/crtend
are imported.  The file README.DELETED contains a list of deleted files
and directories.

License: Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions (LICENSE.TXT).

Built by lib/libcompiler_rt for the Linux host build (tools/linux), where
the gcc runtime (gnu/lib/gcc120) cannot be built with clang.  The list of
sources follows lib/builtins/CMakeLists.txt for x86_64.

No local modifications.
